WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:04,540
What has your brother heard about the current situation outside?

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:08,500
Public dissatisfaction has arisen, and there are many reports of shortfalls, corruption, and indifference.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,820
I heard that His Majesty got angry in the court and issued a decree,

4
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:15,180
Let Dali Si Qing Zhao Xun investigate the matter thoroughly with the prince.

5
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:17,240
The prince takes the lead in investigating the case?

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:21,640
The people involved are so intertwined that if we really want to get to the bottom of it, I'm afraid a conspiracy will be triggered.

7
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,720
The prince most likely wants a car to protect him.

8
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:26,840
Just like this, the people who follow him will inevitably feel chilled.

9
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:28,720
In the future, it will be difficult to win over people's hearts.

10
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:31,000
Our Song family cannot get involved.

11
00:00:31,160 --> 00:00:35,360
This turmoil is dangerous, and the conflict between the factions in the court is even more untouchable.

12
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:38,700
If someone comes to your door, just say no.

13
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:42,880
The people around the prince had already conveyed this to him earlier.

14
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:45,720
Why, are you afraid that I will go against my will? Don't worry.
